{"type":"system","subtype":"task_started","task_id":"ac430d9db13aa61ac","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jkw4Aap4RXVCcRg7bgX1wz","description":"Verify simulation systems","task_type":"local_agent","prompt":"Thoroughly verify the simulation systems in /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/ against these requirements:\n\n1. Temperature system:\n   - Uses dt_s=3600.0, heat_capacity=volume*4186.0\n   - UA from surface and wall areas with top_factor\n   - q_ambient and q_heater calculations correct\n   - Heater never cools the tank\n   - delta_temp formula correct\n\n2. Nitrogen cycle:\n   - Feed -> particulate organics -> dissolved organics -> TAN -> nitrite -> nitrate pathway\n   - Particulate detritus pool, fine detritus pool\n   - DOC and DON pools\n   - Decomposer biomass\n   - Nitrifier guilds: ammonia oxidizers, nitrite oxidizers, comammox\n   - Monod-style rates: rate = vmax * biomass * f_temp * f_pH * f_do * substrate / (k_substrate + substrate)\n   - Biomass-limited, oxygen-limited nitrification\n   - 4.57 mg O2 per 1 mg N nitrified\n   - Rate clamps prevent consuming more than exists\n\n3. Ammonia speciation:\n   - pKa = 0.09018 + 2729.92 / (273.2 + temp_c)\n   - fraction_nh3 = 1.0 / (1.0 + 10.0^(pKa - ph))\n   - NH3 stress stronger than TAN stress\n\n4. Dissolved oxygen:\n   - DO saturation table: 0C->14.6, 10C->11.3, 20C->9.1, 30C->7.6\n   - Reaeration = kLa * (do_sat - do)\n   - Photosynthesis during lit hours only\n   - Respiration from all organisms\n   - Nitrification O2 cost\n\n5. pH and alkalinity:\n   - Nitrification consumes alkalinity (0.1428 meq per 1 mg N)\n   - pH formula: clamp(6.3 + log10(max(alk_meq_l, 0.05)) - log10(max(dic_mmol_l, 0.02)), 5.5, 8.5)\n   - Not constant pH\n\nRead all the system source files and verify formulas match the spec.","uuid":"37ab6162-c7dd-4e31-930a-1c8b177b93e1","session_id":"7c0cd9fe-375d-4881-87c2-86b174651532"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Thoroughly verify the simulation systems in /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/ against these requirements:\n\n1. Temperature system:\n   - Uses dt_s=3600.0, heat_capacity=volume*4186.0\n   - UA from surface and wall areas with top_factor\n   - q_ambient and q_heater calculations correct\n   - Heater never cools the tank\n   - delta_temp formula correct\n\n2. Nitrogen cycle:\n   - Feed -> particulate organics -> dissolved organics -> TAN -> nitrite -> nitrate pathway\n   - Particulate detritus pool, fine detritus pool\n   - DOC and DON pools\n   - Decomposer biomass\n   - Nitrifier guilds: ammonia oxidizers, nitrite oxidizers, comammox\n   - Monod-style rates: rate = vmax * biomass * f_temp * f_pH * f_do * substrate / (k_substrate + substrate)\n   - Biomass-limited, oxygen-limited nitrification\n   - 4.57 mg O2 per 1 mg N nitrified\n   - Rate clamps prevent consuming more than exists\n\n3. Ammonia speciation:\n   - pKa = 0.09018 + 2729.92 / (273.2 + temp_c)\n   - fraction_nh3 = 1.0 / (1.0 + 10.0^(pKa - ph))\n   - NH3 stress stronger than TAN stress\n\n4. Dissolved oxygen:\n   - DO saturation table: 0C->14.6, 10C->11.3, 20C->9.1, 30C->7.6\n   - Reaeration = kLa * (do_sat - do)\n   - Photosynthesis during lit hours only\n   - Respiration from all organisms\n   - Nitrification O2 cost\n\n5. pH and alkalinity:\n   - Nitrification consumes alkalinity (0.1428 meq per 1 mg N)\n   - pH formula: clamp(6.3 + log10(max(alk_meq_l, 0.05)) - log10(max(dic_mmol_l, 0.02)), 5.5, 8.5)\n   - Not constant pH\n\nRead all the system source files and verify formulas match the spec."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jkw4Aap4RXVCcRg7bgX1wz","session_id":"7c0cd9fe-375d-4881-87c2-86b174651532","uuid":"a67219fb-8f33-4296-8482-58c7b195542d"}
