{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HuJSUCDvomrAQtCphCHLwr","type":"tool_result","content":"   970→\n   971→```rust\n   972→pub enum PlayerAction {\n   973→    Feed { grams: f32 },\n   974→    WaterChangePercent { percent: f32, source: SourceWaterProfile },\n   975→    TopOffEvaporation { liters: f32, source: SourceWaterProfile },\n   976→    DoseFertilizer { n_mg: f32, p_mg: f32, k_mg: f32 },\n   977→    TrimPlants { fraction: f32 },\n   978→    SiphonDetritus { fraction: f32 },\n   979→    CleanFilter { intensity: f32 },\n   980→    AddShrimp { count: u32 },\n   981→    RemoveShrimp { count: u32 },\n   982→    ChangePhotoperiod { hours: f32 },\n   983→    ChangeLightIntensity { intensity_index: f32 },\n   984→    ChangeHeaterSetpoint { setpoint_c: f32 },\n   985→    ChangeAmbientTemperature { target_c: f32 },\n   986→    ChangeAeration { enabled: bool, intensity: f32 },\n   987→}\n   988→```\n   989→\n   990→### Important requirement\n   991→`ChangeAmbientTemperature` is mandatory in the public API.\n   992→\n   993→## 11.3 Action semantics\n   994→\n   995→### Feed\n   996→- adds particulate organics\n   997→- increases later detritus and excretion\n   998→- increases food availability\n   999→- may improve reproduction if not excessive\n  1000→\n  1001→### Water change\n  1002→- removes dissolved and suspended constituents proportionally\n  1003→- mixes in source water temperature and chemistry\n  1004→- can cause stress if parameters differ strongly\n  1005→\n  1006→### Top-off\n  1007→- restores volume but usually does not remove dissolved waste\n  1008→- depending on source chemistry, can alter TDS/KH/GH\n  1009→\n  1010→### Clean filter\n  1011→- reduces clogging\n  1012→- may remove nitrifier biomass if too aggressive\n  1013→\n  1014→### Change ambient temperature\n  1015→- changes room environment, not instant water temperature\n  1016→- effect propagates through heat transfer over time\n  1017→\n  1018→---\n  1019→\n  1020→## 12. Update order per tick\n  1021→\n  1022→The order must be explicit and stable.\n  1023→\n  1024→Recommended hourly update pipeline:\n  1025→\n  1026→1. apply scheduled environment updates\n  1027→2. apply queued player actions\n  1028→3. update water volume (evaporation/top-off/water change)\n  1029→4. update temperature from ambient + heater + equipment\n  1030→5. update light state for current hour\n  1031→6. compute gas solubility targets from temperature\n  1032→7. process feeding/excretion pulses\n  1033→8. move detritus through decomposition/mineralization\n  1034→9. update nitrification\n  1035→10. update carbon/oxygen exchange\n  1036→11. update plant photosynthesis/respiration\n  1037→12. update algae/periphyton photosynthesis/respiration\n  1038→13. update pH / alkalinity / NH3 fraction\n  1039→14. update shrimp feeding/stress\n  1040→15. accumulate daily summaries\n  1041→16. emit events / warnings / observations\n  1042→17. recompute observables\n  1043→\n  1044→Daily update pipeline:\n  1045→\n  1046→1. plant biomass growth/senescence\n  1047→2. algae net biomass changes\n  1048→3. microfauna turnover\n  1049→4. shrimp reproduction and juvenile recruitment\n  1050→5. mortality checks\n  1051→6. biofilter maturity trend updates\n  1052→7. weekly/monthly counters if needed\n  1053→\n  1054→---\n  1055→\n  1056→## 13. Event and explanation system\n  1057→\n  1058→The simulation must produce interpretable events.\n  1059→\n  1060→```rust\n  1061→pub struct SimEvent {\n  1062→    pub day: u32,\n  1063→    pub severity: EventSeverity,\n  1064→    pub kind: EventKind,\n  1065→    pub summary: String,\n  1066→    pub causes: Vec<String>,\n  1067→}\n  1068→```\n  1069→\n  1070→Required event kinds:\n  1071→- cycle progressing\n  1072→- ammonia warning\n  1073→- nitrite warning\n  1074→- oxygen dip\n  1075→- algae bloom risk rising\n  1076→- algae bloom underway\n  1077→- biofilm maturity increase\n  1078→- shrimp berried\n  1079→- egg drop / reproductive failure\n  1080→- molt stress warning\n  1081→- filter cleaning setback\n  1082→- substrate fouling warning\n  1083→- stability improving\n  1084→\n  1085→Example:\n  1086→```text\n  1087→Day 41: Moderate warning — night oxygen dip\n  1088→Causes:\n  1089→- high detritus after heavy feeding\n  1090→- strong plant biomass increased night respiration\n  1091→- low aeration\n  1092→- warm ambient temperature reduced oxygen saturation\n  1093→```\n  1094→\n  1095→This layer is essential for learning and gameplay.\n  1096→\n  1097→---\n  1098→\n  1099→## 14. Persistence and data-driven content\n  1100→\n  1101→## 14.1 Config files\n  1102→\n  1103→Use serialized config files for:\n  1104→- tank presets\n  1105→- source water profiles\n  1106→- substrate types\n  1107→- plant guild packs\n  1108→- shrimp species packs\n  1109→- process parameter sets\n  1110→- scenarios\n  1111→\n  1112→## 14.2 Parameter provenance\n  1113→\n  1114→Every important parameter should support metadata:\n  1115→\n  1116→```rust\n  1117→pub struct Parameter<T> {\n  1118→    pub value: T,\n  1119→    pub unit: String,"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YNVA7FgmkLcCKLLvttQAbz","session_id":"7c0cd9fe-375d-4881-87c2-86b174651532","uuid":"fec136ab-aa4a-4230-8899-ad8c9a310ecc"}
