{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jkw4Aap4RXVCcRg7bgX1wz","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! I have all the key system files. Let me now verify each requirement against the code:\n\n## VERIFICATION REPORT\n\n### 1. TEMPERATURE SYSTEM ✓ VERIFIED\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/temperature.rs` (lines 28-69)\n\nVerification:\n- ✓ `dt_s = 3600.0` (line 33)\n- ✓ `heat_capacity_j_per_k = volume_l * 4186.0` (line 39)\n- ✓ UA calculation: `ua_total_w_per_k = (k_surface * surface_area_m2 * top_factor) + (k_wall * wall_area_m2)` (line 48)\n  - Uses `top_exchange_factor()` (line 43)\n  - Combines surface and wall areas correctly\n- ✓ `q_ambient_w = ua_total_w_per_k * (ambient_temp_c - water_temp_c)` (line 53)\n- ✓ `q_heater_w` logic: heater only fires when enabled AND water is below `setpoint_c - deadband_c/2.0` (lines 56-62)\n  - Heater never cools (can only add positive heat or 0)\n  - Clamps to `max(0.0)` after efficiency multiplication (line 60)\n- ✓ Delta temperature formula: `delta_temp_c = (q_ambient_w + q_heater_w) * dt_s / heat_capacity_j_per_k` (line 67)\n- ✓ All formulas match specification exactly\n\n### 2. NITROGEN CYCLE ✓ VERIFIED\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs`\n\n**Pathway verification (lines 43-276):**\n- ✓ Feed leaching: particulate_organics → fine_detritus (lines 44-48)\n- ✓ Fine detritus dissolution: fine_detritus → DOC + DON pools (lines 50-66)\n  - DOC and DON split using N:C ratio (lines 57-59)\n  - Phosphate tracked alongside (lines 60, 64)\n- ✓ Decomposer mineralization: DOC/DON → TAN (lines 69-113)\n  - Monod-style: `rate = vmax * biomass * f_temp * f_do * substrate / (k_substrate + substrate)` (lines 86-87)\n  - Biomass clamped by available DOC/DON (lines 91, 98)\n  - Decomposer growth and decay tracked (lines 110-113)\n- ✓ Nitrification pathways (lines 115-239):\n  - **AOB (Ammonia Oxidizers):** TAN → nitrite\n    - Monod rate (lines 134-140)\n    - O2 cost: 3.43 mg O2 per mg N (line 127)\n    - Environmental factors: f_temp, f_pH, DO availability (line 132-133)\n  - **Comammox:** TAN → nitrate directly\n    - Lower vmax (fraction of AOB) (line 161)\n    - O2 cost: from `pp.o2_per_mg_n_nitrified` (4.57) (line 128)\n  - **NOB (Nitrite Oxidizers):** nitrite → nitrate\n    - O2 cost: 1.14 mg O2 per mg N (line 129)\n\n**Environmental factors (lines 295-312):**\n- ✓ `f_temp`: temperature_factor() bell curve peaking at 28°C (lines 279-284)\n- ✓ `f_pH`: ph_factor() Gaussian centered at 7.5 (lines 287-292)\n- ✓ Maturity factor and dirty filter factor applied (lines 300, 304)\n\n**Rate calculations (lines 315-324):**\n- ✓ Monod formula: `vmax * biomass * environmental_factor * S/(K+S)` (lines 322-323)\n- ✓ Biomass-limited: substrate / (k + substrate) ensures substrate limitation\n- ✓ Oxygen-limited: DO budget clamping (lines 143-147, 176-180, 218-222)\n\n**Rate clamps (per guild):**\n- ✓ AOB: clamped to available TAN, available DO budget, available alk budget (lines 141-152)\n- ✓ Comammox: clamped to remaining TAN, remaining DO, remaining alk (lines 174-185)\n- ✓ NOB: clamped to available nitrite, remaining DO, remaining alk (lines 216-227)\n\n**O2 costs:**\n- ✓ AOB: 3.43 mg O2 per mg N (line 127)\n- ✓ Comammox: 4.57 mg O2 per mg N (via `pp.o2_per_mg_n_nitrified`) (line 128)\n- ✓ NOB: 1.14 mg O2 per mg N (line 129)\n- ✓ Total nitrified N calculation (line 239): `nob_rate + comammox_rate` (tracks only N that reaches nitrate)\n\n**Guild biomass pools:**\n- ✓ `decomposer_biomass_g` (line 69)\n- ✓ `ammonia_oxidizer_biomass_g` (AOB) (line 136)\n- ✓ `nitrite_oxidizer_biomass_g` (NOB) (line 211)\n- ✓ `comammox_biomass_g` (line 169)\n\n**Detritus pools:**\n- ✓ `particulate_organics_g_total` (line 45)\n- ✓ `fine_detritus_g_total` (line 52)\n- ✓ Dissolved pools: `dissolved_organic_carbon_mg_c_total`, `dissolved_organic_nitrogen_mg_n_total` (lines 61-62)\n\n### 3. AMMONIA SPECIATION ✓ VERIFIED\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs` (lines 23-27)\n\n- ✓ `pka = 0.09018 + 2729.92 / (273.2 + temp_c)` (line 24)\n- ✓ `fraction_nh3 = 1.0 / (1.0 + 10.0^(pka - ph))` (line 25)\n- ✓ Multiplied by TAN to get free NH3 (line 26)\n- Formula matches specification exactly\n\n### 4. DISSOLVED OXYGEN ✓ VERIFIED\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/dissolved_oxygen.rs` (lines 9-42)\n\nAlso references: `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/temperature.rs` (lines 3-26)\n\n- ✓ **DO saturation table (lines 3-26 in temperature.rs):**\n  - 0°C → 14.6\n  - 10°C → 11.3\n  - 20°C → 9.1\n  - 30°C → 7.6\n  - Linear interpolation between points (lines 15-22)\n  - Clamping at boundaries (lines 8-13)\n\n- ✓ **Reaeration (lines 22-24 in dissolved_oxygen.rs):**\n  - `k_la = (reaeration_kla_base * top_exchange_factor) + (aeration_kla_boost * aeration_intensity)` (lines 22-23)\n  - `delta_do_reaeration_mg = k_la * (do_sat_mg_l - do_mg_l) * volume_l` (line 24)\n  - Form matches: `kLa * (do_sat - do)` specification\n\n- ✓ **Photosynthesis (lines 30-38):**\n  - Only during `light_on` (line 30)\n  - Produces O2 from photosynthetic biomass (lines 31-35)\n  - Accounts for light intensity (line 35)\n\n- ✓ **Respiration (lines 26-29):**\n  - Background respiration from all respiring organisms (lines 26-29)\n  - Uses `respiring_biomass_g(state)` (line 29)\n\n- ✓ **Nitrification O2 cost:**\n  - Applied in nitrogen_cycle.rs (lines 155, 188, 229)\n  - Debited from `state.water.dissolved_oxygen_mg_total` (lines 203-204, 233-234)\n\n### 5. pH AND ALKALINITY ✓ VERIFIED\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs` (lines 7-60)\n\n- ✓ **pH formula (lines 7-21):**\n  - `pH = 6.3 + log10(max(alk_meq_l, 0.05)) - log10(max(dic_mmol_l, 0.02))` (line 19)\n  - Clamped to [5.5, 8.5] (line 20)\n  - NOT constant pH (recalculated each step from alkalinity and DIC)\n  - Uses `safe_log10()