n  - 30°C → 7.6\n  - Linear interpolation between points (lines 15-22)\n  - Clamping at boundaries (lines 8-13)\n\n- ✓ **Reaeration (lines 22-24 in dissolved_oxygen.rs):**\n  - `k_la = (reaeration_kla_base * top_exchange_factor) + (aeration_kla_boost * aeration_intensity)` (lines 22-23)\n  - `delta_do_reaeration_mg = k_la * (do_sat_mg_l - do_mg_l) * volume_l` (line 24)\n  - Form matches: `kLa * (do_sat - do)` specification\n\n- ✓ **Photosynthesis (lines 30-38):**\n  - Only during `light_on` (line 30)\n  - Produces O2 from photosynthetic biomass (lines 31-35)\n  - Accounts for light intensity (line 35)\n\n- ✓ **Respiration (lines 26-29):**\n  - Background respiration from all respiring organisms (lines 26-29)\n  - Uses `respiring_biomass_g(state)` (line 29)\n\n- ✓ **Nitrification O2 cost:**\n  - Applied in nitrogen_cycle.rs (lines 155, 188, 229)\n  - Debited from `state.water.dissolved_oxygen_mg_total` (lines 203-204, 233-234)\n\n### 5. pH AND ALKALINITY ✓ VERIFIED\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs` (lines 7-60)\n\n- ✓ **pH formula (lines 7-21):**\n  - `pH = 6.3 + log10(max(alk_meq_l, 0.05)) - log10(max(dic_mmol_l, 0.02))` (line 19)\n  - Clamped to [5.5, 8.5] (line 20)\n  - NOT constant pH (recalculated each step from alkalinity and DIC)\n  - Uses `safe_log10()` to prevent errors (lines 80-82)\n\n- ✓ **Alkalinity consumption (lines 52-54, 266 in nitrogen_cycle.rs):**\n  - Respiration increases DIC, decreases alkalinity feedback (lines 52-54)\n  - `ALKALINITY_FEEDBACK_MEQ_PER_MG_C = 0.0002` (line 5)\n  - Nitrification consumes alkalinity: `(aob_rate + comammox_rate + nob_rate) * alk_per_mg_n` (line 266)\n  - `alk_per_mg_n = 0.1428 meq per 1 mg N` (stored in process params, line 123)\n\n- ✓ **Conversions:**\n  - Alkalinity in meq total, converted to meq/L by dividing by volume (line 16)\n  - DIC in mmol/L via conversion from mg C: `(mg_c / 12.0) / volume_l` (line 17)\n\n---\n\n## SUMMARY\n\nAll five major simulation systems have been verified against specifications:\n\n1. **Temperature** - 100% compliant (heat capacity, UA, q_ambient, q_heater, delta_temp formula all correct)\n2. **Nitrogen cycle** - 100% compliant (complete feed-to-nitrate pathway, all guild types, Monod kinetics, O2 costs, rate clamps, biomass pools)\n3. **Ammonia speciation** - 100% compliant (pKa formula and fraction_nh3 calculation)\n4. **Dissolved oxygen** - 100% compliant (saturation table, reaeration, photosynthesis only during light, respiration, nitrification O2 cost)\n5. **pH and alkalinity** - 100% compliant (pH formula with clamping, dynamic recalculation, alkalinity consumption, nitrification cost of 0.1428 meq/mg N)\n\nAll mathematical formulas, constants, and process flows match the specification exactly."}],"totalDurationMs":28965,"totalTokens":27823,"totalToolUseCount":5,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10444,"cache_read_input_tokens":14493,"output_tokens":2880,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10444},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
