{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GDB4poHnAn85sZ7KSvSz31","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0113raF2ycJjpvLFicRb3Qnu","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Verify tests and data files","subagent_type":"Explore","prompt":"Thoroughly verify the acceptance tests and data files in /root/tank-simulation against these requirements:\n\n1. ALL mandatory acceptance tests must exist and test the right things:\n   a. determinism_same_seed: same seed/scenario/actions, 720 hours, identical snapshots\n   b. save_load_resume: run 240h, save, load, run 480h more, match uninterrupted 720h\n   c. water_change_mass_balance: 50% water change, dissolved masses drop by 50% +/- 0.5%\n   d. tank_size_response: 10L vs 100L, peak TAN 5x, thermal response 2x faster\n   e. ambient_temperature_action: gradual rise, DO sat decrease, heater zero\n   f. cycling_seeded_vs_unseeded: seeded reaches low TAN/nitrite first, unseeded shows peaks\n   g. overfeeding_effects: higher detritus, lower nightly DO, higher algae\n   h. rooted_substrate_advantage: active substrate at least 15% higher biomass after 30 days\n   i. thermal_reproduction_penalty: 30C has 20% lower reproductive readiness and fewer juveniles after 60 days\n   j. event_generation: warm/overfed/weak-aeration emits AmmoniaWarning/OxygenDip/AlgaeRiskRising with non-empty cause_codes\n\nRead each test file in /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/tests/ and verify.\n\n2. TOML data files - verify ALL required presets exist with correct content:\n   - Source water: soft_acidic, moderate, hard_shrimp, ro_like (each with id, name, parameters, optional provenance)\n   - Substrate: inert_sand, inert_gravel, active_planted, coarse_porous\n   - Plants: fast_stem, root_rosette\n   - Shrimp: neocaridina_davidi\n   - Process: default\n   - Scenarios: nano_cycle, medium_planted, warm_room\n\nRead the actual TOML files to verify.\n\n3. Save files must be JSON with: schema ver