`/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` (lines 146-152)\n- **APPLIED TO**: TrimPlants, SiphonDetritus, CleanFilter, ChangeLightIntensity, ChangeAeration\n- **CODE**:\n  ```rust\n  fn validate_fraction(field: &'static str, value: f64) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n      validate_finite(field, value)?;\n      if (0.0..=1.0).contains(&value) {\n          Ok(())\n      } else {\n          Err(SimError::FractionOutOfRange { field, value })\n      }\n  }\n  ```\n\n**REQUIREMENT 2.2: Water change percent in 0.0..=100.0**\n- **SPEC**: Water change percent must be 0-100%\n- **IMPLEMENTATION**: ✓ IMPLEMENTED\n- **LOCATION**: `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` (lines 155-161)\n- **CODE**:\n  ```rust\n  fn validate_percent(field: &'static str, value: f64) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n      validate_finite(field, value)?;\n      if (0.0..=100.0).contains(&value) {\n          Ok(())\n      } else {\n          Err(SimError::PercentOutOfRange { field, value })\n      }\n  }\n  ```\n\n**REQUIREMENT 2.3: Counts and grams non-negative**\n- **SPEC**: Feed grams and other numeric counts must be non-negative\n- **IMPLEMENTATION**: ✓ IMPLEMENTED\n- **LOCATION**: `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` (lines 137-143)\n- **APPLIED TO**: Feed, (counts use u32 which is inherently non-negative)\n- **CODE**:\n  ```rust\n  fn validate_non_negative(field: &'static str, value: f64) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n      validate_finite(field, value)?;\n      if value < 0.0 {\n          Err(SimError::NegativeValue { field, value })\n      } else {\n          Ok(())\n      }\n  }\n  ```\n\n**REQUIREMENT 2.4: ChangeAmbientTemperature must NOT instantly set water temp**\n- **SPEC**: \"changes room environment, not instant water temperature\" - \"effect propagates through heat transfer over time\"\n- **IMPLEMENTATION**: ✓ CORRECTLY IMPLEMENTED\n- **LOCATION**: `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs` (lines 213-214)\n- **ACTION 