ture in C (>0)\n11. Change Ambient Temperature - Input: temperature in C (>0)\n12. Change Aeration - Inputs: enabled (toggle), intensity (0-1)\n\nForm features:\n- Field navigation with Up/Down (select action) and Left/Right (select field)\n- Numeric input with decimal support\n- Choice cycling with [ and ] keys\n- Boolean toggle with 't' key\n- Backspace for deletion\n- Input validation and helpful hints\n- Unit tests included (lines 481-513)\n\n**Log Screen** (/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_tui/src/screens/log.rs - 48 lines)\n- Recent Events chronological list\n- Timestamp: Day and hour (24-hour format)\n- Event severity color-coded (Info=gray, Warning=yellow, Critical=red)\n- Event type and kind displayed\n- Summary text\n- Cause codes in brackets\n\n### REQUIREMENT 2: Required Controls - ALL VERIFIED\n\nAll controls documented in status line (lib.rs lines 329-361):\n- **h** - Step 1 hour (lib.rs line 20)\n- **d** - Step 1 day (lib.rs line 21)\n- **w** - Step 1 week (lib.rs line 22)\n- **space** - Toggle pause/autoadvance (lib.rs line 19)\n- **s** - Save to disk (lib.rs lines 23-26)\n- **l** - Load from disk (lib.rs lines 28-31)\n- **q** - Quit application (lib.rs line 17)\n- **Tab** or **1-5** - Screen navigation (lib.rs lines 18, 33-36)\n\n### REQUIREMENT 3: Architecture Requirements - ALL VERIFIED\n\n**TUI uses only TankSnapshot plus action dispatch:**\n- TuiApp struct (lib.rs lines 135-145):\n  - `pub snapshot: TankSnapshot` - read-only display\n  - `pub engine: Engine` - for action dispatch\n  - `snapshot_history: VecDeque<TankSnapshot>` - for trends\n- All screen rendering functions take `&TankSnapshot` (mod.rs line 11)\n- No TankState imports in any TUI file\n\n**TUI does NOT directly mutate low-level state:**\n- `apply_action()` method (lib.rs lines 184-194) dispatches through `self.engine.apply_action()`\n- Snapshot is refreshed after engine processes action (lib.rs line 187)\n- All action validation done through `PlayerAction.validate()` before submission (actions.rs line 351)\n\n### REQUIREMENT 4: Invariants System - ALL VERIFIED\n\n(/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs)\n\n**No negative mass pools:**\n- Lines 7-49: All water chemistry checked non-negative\n- Lines 50-59: Microbe biomass checked non-negative\n- Lines 60-67: Plant and algae biomass checked non-negative\n- Lines 68-79: Substrate nutrients checked non-negative\n- Lines 40-49: Detritus checked non-negative\n\n**No negative populations:**\n- Line 115: `state.animal.clamp_berried_to_adults()` ensures berried <= adults\n- Line 118: `state.animal.egg_cohorts.retain(|c| c.count > 0)` removes empty cohorts\n- All biomass fields checked > 0.0\n\n**0.0 <= index <= 1.0 for health/maturity/stress values:**\n- Lines 95-132: Comprehensive clamping to [0.0, 1.0]:\n  - Light intensity (line 96)\n  - Filter cleanliness (lines 97-98)\n  - Aeration intensity (line 99)\n  - Biofilter maturity (lines 100-101)\n  - Filter clogging (line 102)\n  - Filter seeded biomass (lines 103-104)\n  - Algae nuisance index (line 105)\n  - Microbe maturity (line 106)\n  - Microfauna population (line 107)\n  - Microfauna grazing (lines 108-109)\n  - Shrimp condition (line 110)\n  - Shrimp molt stress (line 111)\n  - Shrimp reproductive readiness (lines 112-113)\n  - Stability tracker (lines 119-120)\n  - Plant guild health/crowding/habitat (lines 123-125)\n  - Substrate layer indices (lines 128-131)\n\n**Temperature above 0.0C:**\n- Lines 80-86: Explicit check that temperature > 0.0C (not just >=0.0)\n- Returns `TemperatureTooLow` error if violated\n- Also validated in PlayerAction validation (actions.rs lines 164-171)\n\n### Architecture Diagram\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│         TUI Application (tank_tui)                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                     │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │  Screens (read-only rendering)              │   │\n│  │  - Overview (chemistry + systems + status)  │   │\n│  │  - Chemistry (dissolved + trends)           │   │\n│  │  - Biology (organisms + biofilter)          │   │\n│  │  - Actions (12 input forms)                 │   │\n│  │  - Log (event chronology)                   │   │\n│  └──────────────────┬──────────────────────────┘   │\n│                     │                               │\n│                     ▼                               │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │  TuiApp (state machine)                     │   │\n│  │  - snapshot: TankSnapshot (READ-ONLY)       │   │\n│  │  - engine: Engine                           │   │\n│  │  - action_form: ActionFormState             │   │\n│  └──────────────────┬──────────────────────────┘   │\n│                     │                               │\n│  ┌──────────────────┴──────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │  Input Handler (input.rs)                   │   │\n│  │  - Key mappings (h/d/w/space/s/l/q)        │   │\n│  │  - Action form input (Up/Down/Left/Right)   │   │\n│  │  - Form submission                          │   │\n│  └──────────────────┬──────────────────────────┘   │\n│                     │                               │\n└─────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┘\n                      │\n                      ▼ (dispatch through)\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│         Core Engine (tank_core)                     │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                     │\n│  apply_action(PlayerAction) → Result<(), SimError> │\n│    └─ Validate action                              │\n│    └─ Update TankState                             │\n│    └─ enforce_invariants()                         │\n│       ├─ No negative pools/populations             │\n│       ├─ 0.0 <= indices <= 1.0                     │\n│       └─ Temperature > 0.0C                        │\n│                                                     │\n│  step_hours(hours) → Result<(), SimError>          │\n│    └─ Simulate world physics                       │\n│    └─ enforce_invariants()                         │\n│                                                     │\n│  snapshot() → TankSnapshot                         │\n│    └─ Extract read-only view of TankState          │\n│                                                     │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Summary\n\nThe TUI implementation is **FULLY COMPLIANT** with all requirements:\n\n✅ All 5 required screens with complete data display\n✅ All 12 action forms with proper field handling\n✅ All 7 required control keys properly mapped\n✅ Clean architecture: TUI reads TankSnapshot, dispatches through Engine\n✅ No low-level state mutation from TUI\n✅ Complete invariants enforcement system with 4 categories of constraints\n\nThe implementation successfully separates concerns: the TUI is a pure presentation layer that reads from immutable snapshots and sends actions to the engine, which validates and applies changes while maintaining system invariants."}],"totalDurationMs":78243,"totalTokens":58046,"totalToolUseCount":32,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1794,"cache_read_input_tokens":53318,"output_tokens":2934,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1794},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
